  cp++;

  // 毛搂碌矛聺藴 矛聽鈥⒚�陈疵�ヂ� 矛露鈥澝�扳偓铆鈥⑴撁�€孤�.
  iSize = iComposeInitMapData(m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_sX - 12,
                              m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_sY - 9, iClientH, cp);
  // 毛漏鈥澝�€古撁�р偓 矛聽鈥灻�€犅�
  iRet = m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_pXSock->iSendMsg(
      pBuffer, 46 + iSize + 4 + 4 + 1 + 4 + 4 + 3); // Zabuza fix
  // iRet = m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_pXSock->iSendMsg(pBuffer, 46 + iSize +4
  // +4 +1 +4 +4); // v1.41
  switch (iRet) {
  case DEF_XSOCKEVENT_QUENEFULL:
  case DEF_XSOCKEVENT_SOCKETERROR:
  case DEF_XSOCKEVENT_CRITICALERROR:
  case DEF_XSOCKEVENT_SOCKETCLOSED:
    // 毛漏鈥澝�€古撁�р偓毛楼录 毛鲁麓毛鈥毬济�€⑴� 矛鈥斅惷�嘎��扳偓
    // 毛掳艙矛茠聺铆鈥撍喢�€孤っ�┞� 矛聽艙锚卤掳铆鈥⑴撁�€孤�.
    DeleteClient(iClientH, true, true);
    if (pBuffer != 0)
      delete[] pBuffer;
    return;
  }

  if (pBuffer != 0)
    delete[] pBuffer;

  // 毛鈥孤っ�ヂ� 铆聛麓毛聺录矛聺麓矛鈥撀该�犅该�€溌っ�€斅惷�才�
